# 📊 Business Insights — Retail Sales Power BI Dashboard

## Executive Summary

The Retail Sales Power BI Dashboard analyzes overall sales, profitability, regional performance, product categories, customer segments, high-value customers, and order seasonality.

The analysis provides insights into business performance and highlights areas that can support better sales, profitability, customer, and operational decisions.

---

